  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DROPPPED-ID-Strat Urban Transport Infra.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The working objectives of the project are to assist: (1) in decentralisation of responsibility for urban transport policy formulation and implemetation from central government to local governments and to assist civil servants in both levels of government adapt to these changes in responsibility; (2) in improving the overall standard of governance in the sector, (3) in the design of transport services and infrastruction targeted for the urban poor, or other vulneable groups.  Inital preparation work for the project is being funded through a Japanese PHRD Grant TF 025207.</narrative>
  </description>
